{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06112","headline":"既蒙宥罪旋复拜官伏感圣恩窃书鄙意兼奉简新除使君等诸公 · 王维","name":"既蒙宥罪旋复拜官伏感圣恩窃书鄙意兼奉简新除使君等诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽蒙汉诏还冠冕，始觉殷王解网罗。\n日比皇明犹自暗，天齐圣寿未云多。\n花迎喜气皆知笑，鸟识欢心亦解歌。\n闻道百城新佩印，还来双阙共鸣珂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}